Fonts for the website, self-hosted so that nothing loads from other sites.

Each is a Latin subset in WOFF2, taken prebuilt from Fontsource's npm
packages (version 5.3.0) through jsDelivr on 2026-11-25, and committed
unchanged. The generator (tools/site.py) only copies them, adding a content
hash to each name. Each family is under the SIL Open Font License 1.1; its
licence text, with the family's copyright line, is the -OFL.txt file
beside it (the package's LICENSE file).

Bricolage Grotesque (headings): variable, axes opsz 12-96 and wght 200-800.
  bricolage-grotesque-latin-opsz-normal.woff2
    https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@fontsource-variable/bricolage-grotesque@5.3.0/files/bricolage-grotesque-latin-opsz-normal.woff2
